king, you can rely on ixigo's assistance. You can also book [Mangalore to Bengaluru train tickets](https://www.confirmtkt.com/trains/mangalore-to-bengaluru-train-tickets) on ConfirmTkt, powered by ixigo.\\n\\n### Mangalore to Bengaluru Fastest Train:\\n\\nTo reach Bengaluru from Mangalore, [16576 Majn Ypr Exp](https://www.ixigo.com/trains/16576) is the fastest train you can take. From Mangalore, it takes 9hr 30min hours to reach Bengaluru. Departing at 07:00:00 from Mangalore MAJN, it arrives at 16:30:00 in Bengaluru. This train operates on Mon, Wed, Fri\\n\\n### Cheapest Train from Mangalore to Bengaluru:\\n\\nFrom Mangalore to Bengaluru, the cheapest train is [16576 Majn Ypr Exp](https://www.ixigo.com/trains/16576). To travel from Mangalore to Bengaluru, the train takes 9hr 30min. The train departs from Mangalore MAJN at 07:00:00 and arrives in Bengaluru YPR at 16:30:00. This train runs on Mon, Wed, Fri.\\n\\n### Mangalore to Bengaluru Last Train:\\n\\nFrom Mangalore, [16512 Can Sbc Express](https://www.ixigo.com/trains/16512) is the last train you can take to reach Bengaluru. To travel from Mangalore to Bengaluru, it takes this train 9hr 35min hours. Departing from Mangalore MAJN at 20:27:00, it arrives in Bengaluru YPR at 06:02:00. 16512 Can Sbc Express operates on Mon, Tues, Wed, Thur, Fri, Sat, Sun.\\n\\n### First Train from Mangalore to Bengaluru:\\n\\nThe train that runs first from Mangalore to Bengaluru is [16576 Majn Ypr Exp](https://www.ixigo.com/trains/16576). From Mangalore it arrives at Bengaluru taking almost 9hr 30min hours. This train departs from Mangalore MAJN at 07:00:00 and arrives in Bengaluru YPR at 16:30:00. The days on which this train operates are Mon, Wed, Fri.\\n\\n### Check online PNR status from Mangalore to Bengaluru:\\n\\nIf the journey starts from Mangalore and ends at Bengaluru, users can use the [PNR status enquiry](https://www.ixigo.com/pnr-status-enquiry) feature and check the status online at ixigo. It offers updated PNR information.\\n\\n## Mangalore to Bengaluru Trains Seat Availability\\n\\nCheck Mangalore to Bengaluru [**train seat availability**](https://www.ixigo.com/trains/train-seat-availability) on ixigo. Enter the train name or number and hit the search button. You will find the seat availability for different classes along with the fares for the next 60 days. You can also check the availability for various quotas.\\n\\n[16566 Seat Availability](https://www.ixigo.com/trains/16566/seat-availability)\\n\\n[16512 Seat Availability](https://www.ixigo.com/trains/16512/seat-availability)\\n\\n[16576 Seat Availability](https://www.ixigo.com/trains/16576/seat-availability)\\n\\n[16586 Seat Availability](https://www.ixigo.com/trains/16586/seat-availability)\\n\\n## Mangalore to Bengaluru Trains Running Status\\n\\nCheck Mangalore to Bengaluru [**train running status**](https://www.ixigo.com/trains/train-running-status) on ixigo. Enter the train number or name into the search box and hit the search button. You will find the complete train timetable, stoppage information and delay at each station (if any) during the journey. You can also check the platform number and coach position of the train through the feature.\\n\\n[16566 Running Status](https://www.ixigo.com/trains/16566/running-status)\\n\\n[16512 Running Status](https://www.ixigo.com/trains/16512/running-status)\\n\\n[16576 Running Status](https://www.ixigo.com/trains/16576/running-status)\\n\\n[16586 Running Status](https://www.ixigo.com/trains/16586/running-status)\\n\\n## Frequently Asked Questions (FAQs)\\n\\n### **Q. Between Mangalore to Bengaluru how many trains run everyday?**\\n\\nA. Between Mangalore to Bengaluru, 4 trains run everyday.\\n\\n### **Q. From Mangalore how many trains are there to Bengaluru each week?**\\n\\nA. From Mangalore there are 4 trains to Bengaluru each week.\\n\\n### **Q. What is the distance that needs to be covered to reach Bengaluru from Mangalore?**\\n\\nA. To reach Bengaluru from Mangalore, 413 km needs to be covered.\\n\\n### **Q. What is the number of railway stations in Mangalore?**\\n\\nA. The number of railway station in Mangalore is 7. [**book train tickets**](https://www.ixigo.com/trains)\\n\\n### **Q. In the entire city of Bengaluru how many railway stations are there?**\\n\\nA. In the entire city of Bengaluru, there are 14 railway stations.\\n\\n### **Q. For travelling from Mangalore to Bengaluru, what time do trains take on this route?**\\n\\nA. For travelling from Mangalore to Bengaluru, trains take 9hr 30min on this route.\\n\\n### **Q. The journey starts from Mangalore and ends at Bengaluru. For availing Taktal reservation, one must try how many days in advance from date of journey?**\\n\\nA. The journey starts from Mangalore and ends at Bengaluru. For availing Tatkal reservation, one must try one day in advance from date of journey\\n\\n### **Q. Running between Mangalore and Bengaluru which train is the slowest? Provide necessary details about it**\\n\\nA. Running between Mangalore and Bengaluru Maq Ypr Express is the slowest train. It departs from Mangalore at 20:00:00 and reaches Bengaluru at 13:00:00. Maq Ypr Express cover a distance of 413 kms.\\n\\n### **Q. Can I get the latest online information about train running status via NTES, from Mangalore to Bengaluru?**\\n\\nA. One can get latest online information about [**train running status**](https://www.ixigo.com/trains/train-running-status) via NTES train enquiry or ixigo app, for Mangalore to Bengaluru.\\n\\n### **Q. Is it possible to check IRCTC seat availability with fare and timings online, if travelling from Mangalore to Bengaluru??**\\n\\nA. If you are travelling from Mangalore to Bengaluru then it is possible to check [**irctc seat availability with fare and timings**](https://www.ixigo.com/trains/train-seat-availability) online by simply using ixigo app.\\n\\n### **Q. What is the time frame for IRCTC booking online for trains between Mangalore and Bengaluru?**\\n\\nA. [**IRCTC booking online**](https://www.ixigo.com/trains) for trains between Mangalore and Bengaluru can be made 120 days in advance of travel. Tatkal tickets can be booked one day in advance of travel.\\n\\n## Popular Train routes from Mangalore\\n\\n[mangalore to goa Trains](https://www.ixigo.com/by-train-rail/mangalore-to-goa-by-train)\\n\\n[mangalore to kannur Trains](https://www.ixigo.com/by-train-rail/mangalore-to-kannur-by-train)\\n\\n[mangalore to mumbai Trains](https://www.ixigo.com/by-train-rail/mangalore-to-mumbai-by-train)\\n\\n[mangalore to calicut Trains](https://www.ixigo.com/by-train-rail/mangalore-to-calicut-by-train)\\n\\n[mangalore to kochi Trains](https://www.ixigo.com/by-train-rail/mangalore-to-kochi-by-train)\\n\\n[mangalore to prayagraj Trains](https://www.ixigo.com/by-train-rail/mangalore-to-prayagraj-by-train)\\n\\n[mangalore to coimbatore Trains](https://www.ixigo.com/by-train-rail/mangalore-to-coimbatore-by-train)\\n\\n[mangalore to puttur Trains](https://www.ixigo.com/by-train-rail/mangalore-to-puttur-by-train)\\n\\n[mangalore to chennai Trains](https://www.ixigo.com/by-train-rail/mangalore-to-chennai-by-train)\\n\\n[mangalore to trivandrum Trains](https://www.ixigo.com/by-train-rail/mangalore-to-trivandrum-by-train)\\n\\n[mangalore to new delhi Trains](https://www.ixigo.com/by-train-rail/mangalore-to-new-delhi-by-train)\\n\\n[mangalore to ajmer Trains](https://www.ixigo.com/by-train-rail/mangalore-to-ajmer-by-train)\\n\\n[mangalore to jammu Trains](https://www.ixigo.com/by-train-rail/mangalore-to-jammu-by-train)\\n\\n[mangalore to varanasi Trains](https://www.ixigo.com/by-train-rail/mangalore-to-varanasi-by-train)\\n\\n[mangalore to tirupati Trains](https://www.ixigo.com/by-train-rail/mangalore-to-tirupati-by-train)\\n\\n[mangalore to delhi Trains](https://www.ixigo.com/by-train-rail/mangalore-to-delhi-by-train)\\n\\n[mangalore to hyderabad Trains](https://www.ixigo.com/by-train-rail/mangalore-to-hyderabad-by-train)\\n\\n[mangalore to shirdi Trains](